                "accordion_row_7PAkUx": {
                  "type": "_accordion-row",
                  "settings": {
                    "heading": "Shipping Policy",
                    "open_by_default": false,
                    "icon": "box",
                    "width": 20
                  },
                  "blocks": {
                    "text_DLmEPK": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>At <strong>Legendary Branding</strong>, we are committed to getting your order to you as quickly, safely, and smoothly as possible.</p><h4>Order Processing</h4><p>All orders are processed within <strong>2 business days</strong>.</p><ul><li>You will receive an order confirmation email after your purchase is placed.</li><li>You will receive a shipping confirmation email with tracking information once your order has shipped.</li><li>Orders are not typically processed or shipped on weekends or holidays.</li></ul><h4>Shipping Rates & Delivery Times</h4><p><strong>We offer free worldwide shipping on all orders.</strong></p><p>USA & Canada 7–10 business days</p><p>UK & Europe 10–12 business days</p><p>Australia & New Zealand 10–12 business days</p><p>Rest of World 10–12 business days</p><p><em><strong>Delivery times are estimates only and may vary due to carrier delays, destination, weather, peak periods, or customs processing for international shipments.</strong></em></p><h4>Tracking Your Order</h4><p>Once your order ships, you will receive a tracking link by email so you can follow your shipment along the way.</p><p>If your tracking information does not update right away, please allow a few business days for the carrier to scan and refresh the tracking status.</p><h4>Lost or Delayed Packages</h4><p>If your package appears delayed, lost, or stalled in transit, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:lb@legendary-branding.com\">lb@legendary-branding.com</a>.</p><p>We will work with the shipping carrier to investigate the issue and determine the next best resolution, which may include a replacement or other support where appropriate.</p><h4>International Customs & Duties</h4><p>Orders shipped outside the United States may be subject to customs duties, import taxes, or other local fees charged by the destination country.</p><p>These charges are the responsibility of the customer unless otherwise stated at checkout. International shipments may also experience customs-related delays outside our control. It is standard practice for e-commerce merchants to state clearly whether duties and taxes are paid by the customer or collected upfront. </p><h4>Shipping Delays</h4><p>We do our best to meet the shipping and delivery estimates shown on our store. If we cannot ship within the time frame advertised, we will contact you with an update and, when required, provide the option to cancel for a prompt refund in line with applicable FTC rules. </p><h4>Need Help?</h4><p>For any shipping questions, please contact us at:</p><p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:lb@legendary-branding.com\">lb@legendary-branding.com</a></p>",
                        "width": "100%",
                        "max_width": "normal",
