        "heading": "QUALITY OVER QUANTITY",
        "body": "<p>We build for the ones who know the difference. <strong>460GSM</strong> hoodies. <strong>235GSM+</strong> tees. Every garment <strong>DTG printed </strong>and built to outlast.</p><p><strong>Legendary Branding</strong> isn’t a brand — it’s a <strong>standard</strong>.</p>",
