                "padding-inline-end": 0
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "text_QHhKhY": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Legendary Branding was built on a simple belief that greatness isn’t a moment, it’s a mindset you wear every day. Forged through years of trial, iteration, and obsession with the details, the brand exists to create pieces that <strong>outlast trends and fragile blanks</strong>. </p><p>Every <strong>heavyweight tee and hoodie</strong> is designed to feel substantial in your hands and on your shoulders, with <strong>durable fabrics</strong> and prints that hold up to real life, not just a photoshoot. </p><p>Legendary Branding is <em><strong>more than a logo</strong></em>, it’s a commitment to building something that reflects the grind, resilience, and the \"<strong>bigger picture</strong>\" thinking of a persons intent to becoming <strong>legendary</strong> in whatever they do.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "normal",
                "alignment": "center",
                "type_preset": "custom",
                "font": "var(--font-accent--family)",
                "font_size": "1.25rem",
